	<div class="container grid-2">
		<div>
			<Image src={vennDiagram} alt="Hacker, Hustler, Hipster Venn diagram" width={563} height={525} />
		</div>
		<div class="hide-mobile">
			<h2>HACKERS, HUSTLERS AND HIPSTERS!</h2>
			<p>If technology were a sport, there'd be 3 positions on the team.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<strong
						>Hackers build: build code, build robots, or build "things" with 3D printers.</strong
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Hipsters make everything pixel perfect, through their love of design.</strong>
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Hustlers turn our dreams into reality by making sure the job gets done.</strong>
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p>No single role is more important than another – all 3 are crucial to tech success!</p>
			<p>
				You may have a favourite role, but knowing all 3 skills makes you stronger. (Just enough to be
				dangerous!)
			</p>
			<p>
				<strong
					>Not sure if you're a hacker, hustler or a hipster, chances are you are more than one –
					with crossover skills like on our cool Venn diagram!</strong
				>
			</p>
		</div>
